      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Omotesando is celebrated as an architectural showcase, hosting flagship stores of major fashion brands side by side.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Omotesand%C5%8D",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "It serves as the main vehicle and pedestrian thoroughfare linking Harajuku and Aoyama.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Omotesand%C5%8D",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The street houses iconic spots like Kiddyland toy store, Laforet, and the Oriental Bazaar.",
